      "content": "<h3>Creating a LinkedHashMap</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><code>new LinkedHashMap&lt;&gt;()</code>: empty, insertion order.</li>\n<li><code>new LinkedHashMap&lt;&gt;(int initialCapacity)</code> and <code>(int, float loadFactor)</code>: tune the table.</li>\n<li><code>new LinkedHashMap&lt;&gt;(int, float, boolean accessOrder)</code>: <code>true</code> means <strong>access order</strong>.</li>\n<li><code>new LinkedHashMap&lt;&gt;(Map m)</code>: a copy in the iteration order of m.</li>\n</ul>",
