      "content": "<h3>7. putFirst, putLast and reversed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Signature:</strong> <code>V putFirst(K, V);  V putLast(K, V);  SequencedMap<K, V> reversed()</code></li>\n<li><strong>Returns:</strong> the previous value / a reversed view</li>\n<li><strong>Time:</strong> O(1)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>For freshers:</strong> <code>putFirst</code> and <code>putLast</code> add a pair at the <strong>front</strong> or the <strong>back</strong>; if the key already exists it is <strong>moved</strong> there. <code>reversed()</code> is a live view that walks from the last entry to the first.</p>\n<p><strong>For experienced developers:</strong> This finally allows reordering a LinkedHashMap without removing and re-adding. <code>sequencedKeySet()</code>, <code>sequencedValues()</code> and <code>sequencedEntrySet()</code> give the same ordered views with <code>getFirst</code>, <code>getLast</code> and <code>reversed</code>.</p>",
